class_name WallJumpGap
extends Marker3D
## Marks a Gap with short walls alternating sides along it, none long enough to cross on one
## Wall-run, so the Runner Wall-jumps from each wall to the next. Placed like a [Gap]: at its near
## edge, in the middle across, at floor height 0, running along -Z to the floor beyond. The floor
## and the walls make the Wall-jump gap, not this marker.
